{"id":"c922518c30c4107d","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-canonical-model.md","title":"Canonical Model","display":"df-canonical-model — Canonical Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-canonical-model","aliases":["89-df-canonical-model"],"display":"df-canonical-model — Canonical Model","depends_on":["[[89-df-box-modality]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","[[89-df-modal-implication]]","[[89-df-kripke-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-canonical-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-canonical-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-canonical-model — Canonical Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d246470e97fec132\" href=\"?note=d246470e97fec132\" title=\"89-df-box-modality\">89-df-box-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"32c9990061b9749d\" href=\"?note=32c9990061b9749d\" title=\"89-df-modal-implication\">89-df-modal-implication</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bdef52f3ff411531\" href=\"?note=bdef52f3ff411531\" title=\"89-df-normal-modal-logic\">89-df-normal-modal-logic</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nW_L\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\land L\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land\\bot\\notin\\Gamma\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n((A\\in\\Gamma\\land(A\\to B)\\in\\Gamma)\\to B\\in\\Gamma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n(A\\in\\Gamma\\lor\\neg A\\in\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma R_L\\Delta\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in W_L\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n(\\Box A\\in\\Gamma\\to A\\in\\Delta)\\bigr),\\\\\nV_L(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\in W_L\\mid p\\in\\Gamma\\}\n\\quad(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\n\\mathcal{M}_L&amp;\\coloneqq(W_L,R_L,V_L).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nW_L\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\land L\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land\\bot\\notin\\Gamma\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n((A\\in\\Gamma\\land(A\\to B)\\in\\Gamma)\\to B\\in\\Gamma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n(A\\in\\Gamma\\lor\\neg A\\in\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma R_L\\Delta\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in W_L\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n(\\Box A\\in\\Gamma\\to A\\in\\Delta)\\bigr),\\\\\nV_L(p)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\in W_L\\mid p\\in\\Gamma\\}\n\\quad(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\n\\mathcal{M}_L&amp;\\coloneqq(W_L,R_L,V_L).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The canonical model has all maximal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-consistent sets as worlds; it is\nthe standard model used in completeness proofs, not a largest model under\nset inclusion. The explicit <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\)</span> guard records the construction's\ndeclared domain; under the hypothesis it does not change the world set.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-box-modality","status":"resolved","id":"d246470e97fec132","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-normal-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bdef52f3ff411531","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-implication","status":"resolved","id":"32c9990061b9749d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-implication]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-normal-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bdef52f3ff411531","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ and $\\mathrm{Normal}(L)$ (see [[89-df-normal-modal-logic]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}canonical\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nW_L\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\mid{}&\n\\mathrm{Normal}(L)\\land L\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land\\bot\\notin\\Gamma\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n((A\\in\\Gamma\\land(A\\to B)\\in\\Gamma)\\to B\\in\\Gamma)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n(A\\in\\Gamma\\lor\\neg A\\in\\Gamma)\\},\\\\\n\\Gamma R_L\\Delta\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in W_L\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\n(\\Box A\\in\\Gamma\\to A\\in\\Delta)\\bigr),\\\\\nV_L(p)&\\coloneqq\\{\\Gamma\\in W_L\\mid p\\in\\Gamma\\}\n\\quad(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}),\\\\\n\\mathcal{M}_L&\\coloneqq(W_L,R_L,V_L).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(L)","display":false}],"bytes":1473,"backlinks":[{"id":"f233d5485efaad7c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-canonical-model]]：逻辑的典范模型"},{"id":"170626a7dad88370","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-canonical-model]]：典范模型与过滤的对比"},{"id":"cf7dbabb97c0679f","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-canonical-model]]：典范模型（通常无限）"},{"id":"6f068c38418e21f2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$(\\mathcal M_L)_{L}$ is the canonical-model construction from\n[[89-df-canonical-model]]."},{"id":"570349aa538831d0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{M}_{\\mathrm{GL}}$ : GL典范模型 (see [[89-df-canonical-model]])"},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-canonical-model]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom.md]]\n[[89-df-accessibility.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation.md]]\n[[89-df-arith